{
  "name": "Post call summaries and transcripts to Slack automatically with Ringee",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Call transcripts → Slack\nEvery time a call recording is ready, this workflow posts the AI summary, the opening of the transcript and a link to the call to Slack.\n\nRingee has no separate “transcript ready” event. The transcript travels with **Recording Ready** (and with the call events), and when it is not there yet this workflow waits and asks for it.\n\n[Ringee](https://ringee.io) · [Docs](https://docs.ringee.io)",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7dd2901b-b975-5b84-a29b-e19e24dee3a4",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Before you run this**\n1. In Ringee, create a **Custom Integration** (Integrations → Custom Integrations) and copy its **API key** and **Signing Secret**.\n2. In n8n, create a **Ringee API** credential with both.\n3. Pick your AI voice agent in the Ringee node.\n4. Activate the workflow, then paste the **Ringee Trigger's Production URL** into the integration's **Outbound URL** and tick *Recording Ready*.\n\nConnect **Slack** and pick the channel. Recordings and transcripts are sensitive: post them only to a private channel your team is allowed to see, and follow your recording-consent rules.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "396612bd-bd6e-5267-8b0d-97ba1cb1268e",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -30
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "recording.ready"
        ],
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4c285002-062b-572e-868f-f0d573e4a913",
      "name": "Recording ready",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringeeTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        -80
      ],
      "webhookId": "7a0ae0b7-2266-5635-a2a4-e5dc8f815b26"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "eea4bfd8-4209-5a77-98d1-186940fa4e57",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.call?.transcription?.text || $json.data.transcript || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e8bf8377-6044-54a0-81dc-0e0f9d1401f1",
      "name": "Transcript included?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        500,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 3,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "926d3a12-e79a-54df-bb2d-985a7eb65be5",
      "name": "Wait 3 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        740,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "6ca3e6f3-c6fe-58cd-a567-2575f428ab86"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "transcript",
        "operation": "get",
        "callId": "={{ $('Recording ready').item.json.data.callId }}",
        "includeSegments": false
      },
      "id": "63397061-b66e-55ca-8ae2-2e45070bac91",
      "name": "Get transcript",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        980,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "transcript",
        "operation": "getSummary",
        "callId": "={{ $('Recording ready').item.json.data.callId }}"
      },
      "id": "2f288247-b739-5dbf-a26a-d2a37495d59e",
      "name": "Get AI summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ringee.ringee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "76b3d9a0-7e15-5124-8171-522ec158468b",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ ($('Get transcript').item?.json.text || $('Recording ready').item.json.data.call?.transcription?.text || $('Recording ready').item.json.data.transcript || '') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "521e880e-4102-5d69-81aa-8edf72ea7ba5",
              "name": "summary",
              "value": "={{ $json.summary || $('Recording ready').item.json.data.call?.voiceAgentCall?.summary || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ecf19cca-f47e-58cd-acde-1420898a750c",
      "name": "Write the Slack message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        1460,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "76b3d9a0-7e15-5124-8171-522ec158468b",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.call?.transcription?.text || $json.data.transcript || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "521e880e-4102-5d69-81aa-8edf72ea7ba5",
              "name": "summary",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.call?.voiceAgentCall?.summary || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e6652a61-c4d4-54df-9647-760099c5d58f",
      "name": "Write the Slack message (transcript already here)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        740,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#call-notes",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "={{ ':studio_microphone: *Call recorded*' + ($('Recording ready').item.json.data.call?.toNumber ? ' with ' + $('Recording ready').item.json.data.call.toNumber : '') + '\\n' + ($json.summary ? '*Summary:* ' + $json.summary + '\\n' : '') + '*Transcript:* ' + ($json.text ? $json.text.slice(0, 700) + ($json.text.length > 700 ? '…' : '') : '_not available yet_') }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "7406c7c1-adfb-5f40-9acf-1baacb6675c9",
      "name": "Post to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        1700,
        -20
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Recording ready": {
      "main": [
